        "payload": "tree e234f40593c6d5bf07c9e10334b7f62f980570b5\nparent 5aadddb511a5dcfe4599531bd8ae5e5b96d0f793\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1793520461 +0700\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1793520461 +0700\n\nBIP-352: add test vectors for skipped inputs and label edge cases\n\nFive send and receive vectors for cases the file does not cover yet:\n- inputs of ineligible types (P2WSH, P2MS, P2PK, empty scriptPubKey)\n  beside an eligible one;\n- a P2SH-P2WSH input beside an eligible one, which is skipped;\n- a P2TR script path spend whose internal key is not NUMS, which counts;\n- the largest label, 0xFFFFFFFF;\n- two recipients, one with a labeled address listed after the other\n  recipient, with a taproot and a non-taproot input.\n\nThe P2WSH and P2SH-P2WSH witness script is also a valid compressed key,\nso an implementation that reads the last witness item as a key fails.\n\nreference.py computed the expected values and passes on the whole file.\n",
